{"sections":{"banner":{"type":"main-collection-banner","settings":{"show_collection_description":true,"show_collection_image":true,"color_scheme":"background-1"}},"00311ab2-6cd5-4351-b218-6134ed3904cb":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--16020775272605__00311ab2-6cd5-4351-b218-6134ed3904cb-1674936743bac513b5-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Impresion 3D Filamentos","heading_size":"h2"}}},"block_order":["template--16020775272605__00311ab2-6cd5-4351-b218-6134ed3904cb-1674936743bac513b5-0"],"settings":{"desktop_content_position":"center","content_alignment":"center","color_scheme":"background-1","full_width":true,"padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0}},"product-grid":{"type":"main-collection-product-grid","settings":{"products_per_page":20,"columns_desktop":3,"image_ratio":"portrait","show_secondary_image":true,"show_vendor":false,"show_rating":false,"enable_quick_add":true,"enable_filtering":false,"filter_type":"horizontal","enable_sorting":false,"columns_mobile":"2","padding_top":24,"padding_bottom":28}},"59e9f1cc-f109-4583-a165-3e82a05c00dd":{"type":"custom-liquid","settings":{"custom_liquid":"<div id=\"CaracteristicasFilamentoPLA\">","color_scheme":"background-1","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0}},"rich-text-1":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"0d9c6775-b689-41ea-a656-c7c4c3a28b54":{"type":"caption","settings":{"caption":"Todas las caracteristicas del Mejor:","text_style":"caption-with-letter-spacing","text_size":"large"}},"heading":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"PLA","heading_size":"hxl"}}},"block_order":["0d9c6775-b689-41ea-a656-c7c4c3a28b54","heading"],"settings":{"desktop_content_position":"center","content_alignment":"center","color_scheme":"accent-2","full_width":true,"padding_top":60,"padding_bottom":60}},"image-with-text-0":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Grosor del pla plastico","heading_size":"h2"}},"text":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>El grosor de nuestros filamentos es de <strong>1,75 mm<\/strong> con una tolerancia de ± 0,05mm.<br\/>Todos nuestros filamentos están estandarizados para conservar el mismo diámetro en toda la extensión del filamento.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["heading","text"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/1_75_mm_de_diametro_FF_-_Ligera.png","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":20,"padding_bottom":0}},"71977e41-92ed-459a-88dd-6cc0634954ca":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--16020775272605__71977e41-92ed-459a-88dd-6cc0634954ca-16749407075df3b98f-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"¿ Cuánto trae un rollo de pla 3d?","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--16020775272605__71977e41-92ed-459a-88dd-6cc0634954ca-16749407075df3b98f-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Cada uno de nuestros filamentos están cuidadosamente enrollado con 1kg de filamento PLA<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["template--16020775272605__71977e41-92ed-459a-88dd-6cc0634954ca-16749407075df3b98f-0","template--16020775272605__71977e41-92ed-459a-88dd-6cc0634954ca-16749407075df3b98f-1"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Cinco_hermosos_Rollos_de_filamento_PLA_y_huevos_Print3x_Recortada_Grande_-_Ligera.jpg","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":20,"padding_bottom":0}},"57961ecc-b948-4b54-a0d7-79173ee2e303":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--16020775272605__57961ecc-b948-4b54-a0d7-79173ee2e303-1675104525ca943ffb-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"¿ Cuántos metros trae de pla 1.75 mm ?","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--16020775272605__57961ecc-b948-4b54-a0d7-79173ee2e303-1675104525ca943ffb-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>En el carrete hay enrollados 335,29 mt de filamento PLA<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["template--16020775272605__57961ecc-b948-4b54-a0d7-79173ee2e303-1675104525ca943ffb-0","template--16020775272605__57961ecc-b948-4b54-a0d7-79173ee2e303-1675104525ca943ffb-1"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Cuatro_Rollos_de_filamento_PLA_y_huevos_Print3x_98ce26f8-05da-4515-8597-dd08f45b0bdc.jpg","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":20,"padding_bottom":0}},"image-with-text-1":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Color Homogéneo del filamento 3d","heading_size":"h2"}},"text":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Las propiedades del filamento PLA que agregan los complejantes (aditivos para darle el color, otorgarle protección contra el UV y la hidrólisis) están completamente <strong>homogéneos <\/strong>(repartidos uniformemente) a lo largo del filamento.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["heading","text"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/cientifico-mezclando-liquidos_1423-1805.png","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"small","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":20,"padding_bottom":0}},"image-with-text-2":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Anti-Atascos del filamento 3d","heading_size":"h2"}},"text":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Gracias uno de los aditivos introducidos en su elaboración, se previenen la mayoría de los atascos producto de autolimpieza del nozzle.<\/p><p>Con una temperatura de trabajo de 200 a 220 °C<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["heading","text"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/2_Extrusor_Tapado_Print3x.png","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":20,"padding_bottom":0}},"1a9f095f-fbce-4de6-a966-c3a4fc9d10e0":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--16017383227549__1a9f095f-fbce-4de6-a966-c3a4fc9d10e0-1674229600fd504cf0-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Temperatura de Extrusión del 3d filamento","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--16017383227549__1a9f095f-fbce-4de6-a966-c3a4fc9d10e0-1674229600fd504cf0-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>La temperatura de extrusión se encuentra entre 205 a 220° C<br\/>¿Por qué esta diferencia? Depende de la cercanía del sensor de temperatura con el boquilla-Nozzle.<\/p><p><strong>T° de extrusión:<\/strong> 205 a 220 °C<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["template--16017383227549__1a9f095f-fbce-4de6-a966-c3a4fc9d10e0-1674229600fd504cf0-0","template--16017383227549__1a9f095f-fbce-4de6-a966-c3a4fc9d10e0-1674229600fd504cf0-1"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Emoji_hot_and_cold2.png","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":20,"padding_bottom":0}},"43a9d0ce-bb10-4e87-bdf4-21efc9765781":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--16017383227549__43a9d0ce-bb10-4e87-bdf4-21efc9765781-1674229600fd504cf0-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Cero Burbujas del material impresora 3d","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--16017383227549__43a9d0ce-bb10-4e87-bdf4-21efc9765781-1674229600fd504cf0-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Las burbujas son pequeñas bolsas de aire que quedan el el proceso de fabricación del plástico, al momento de derretir el plástico a alta temperatura, la burbuja se expande por el calor y genera pequeñas explosiones de plásticos y estropean su impresión.<br\/>En Print3x nos encargamos de seleccionar un proveedor que ha logrado llegar al nivel de <strong>CERO BURBUJAS<\/strong> para que no tengas esos problemas.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["template--16017383227549__43a9d0ce-bb10-4e87-bdf4-21efc9765781-1674229600fd504cf0-0","template--16017383227549__43a9d0ce-bb10-4e87-bdf4-21efc9765781-1674229600fd504cf0-1"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Burbujas_en_el_filamento.png","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":20,"padding_bottom":0}},"b401815a-b740-4163-b0fc-f6890dda8456":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--16017383227549__b401815a-b740-4163-b0fc-f6890dda8456-1674229600fd504cf0-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Materiales impresora 3d No Toxico","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--16017383227549__b401815a-b740-4163-b0fc-f6890dda8456-1674229600fd504cf0-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Nos hemos asegurado de que, en el caso poco probable de que se coma un poco de nuestro PLA, éste no le ocasione ningún tipo de indigestión<\/p><p>Pd: lo hemos comido. :D<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["template--16017383227549__b401815a-b740-4163-b0fc-f6890dda8456-1674229600fd504cf0-0","template--16017383227549__b401815a-b740-4163-b0fc-f6890dda8456-1674229600fd504cf0-1"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Check.png","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":20,"padding_bottom":0}},"c162dd3d-22ca-44ae-a1df-4ec1c98d7d46":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--16017383227549__c162dd3d-22ca-44ae-a1df-4ec1c98d7d46-1674229600fd504cf0-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"3dfilamento Inocuo","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--16017383227549__c162dd3d-22ca-44ae-a1df-4ec1c98d7d46-1674229600fd504cf0-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>El PLA es de origen vegetal, de la hoja del maíz, y <strong>no reacciona<\/strong> con los alimentos ni materiales biológicos como la piel.<br\/>Los complejantes (aditivos para darle el color, otorgarle protección contra el UV y la hidrólisis) que ocupa el proveedor seleccionado tambien son inocuos con alimentos y objetos biologicos.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["template--16017383227549__c162dd3d-22ca-44ae-a1df-4ec1c98d7d46-1674229600fd504cf0-0","template--16017383227549__c162dd3d-22ca-44ae-a1df-4ec1c98d7d46-1674229600fd504cf0-1"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Emogiis.png","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":20,"padding_bottom":0}},"a8dfa0bb-668b-4e0c-8c35-c176046ad072":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--16017383227549__a8dfa0bb-668b-4e0c-8c35-c176046ad072-1674229600fd504cf0-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"filamento3d Sin Auto-quiebre","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--16017383227549__a8dfa0bb-668b-4e0c-8c35-c176046ad072-1674229600fd504cf0-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Existen en el mercado filamentos de baja calidad que se quiebran solos, uno los deja quietos y se quiebra el material.<\/p><p>El Auto-Quiebre es especialmente grave cuando se esta imprimiendo ya que se pierden horas valiosas de impresión. Con nuestro filamento eso no te pasara 😎<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["template--16017383227549__a8dfa0bb-668b-4e0c-8c35-c176046ad072-1674229600fd504cf0-0","template--16017383227549__a8dfa0bb-668b-4e0c-8c35-c176046ad072-1674229600fd504cf0-1"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Filamento_PLA_roto_autoquiebre.png","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":20,"padding_bottom":0}},"b9662c22-255d-4fa0-b924-9df05f4b9321":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--16017383227549__b9662c22-255d-4fa0-b924-9df05f4b9321-1674229600fd504cf0-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"¿ Material PLA Biodegradable ?","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--16017383227549__b9662c22-255d-4fa0-b924-9df05f4b9321-1674229600fd504cf0-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Hay bacterias en la tierra que se comen nuestro PLA, el PLA es un  polímero biodegradable desde su origen en las plantas de maíz.<br\/><br\/>¿Cuánto se demora en degradarse?<br\/>Al Aire libre: 75 años.<br\/>Enterrado en tierra y molido: 2 años.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["template--16017383227549__b9662c22-255d-4fa0-b924-9df05f4b9321-1674229600fd504cf0-0","template--16017383227549__b9662c22-255d-4fa0-b924-9df05f4b9321-1674229600fd504cf0-1"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Biodegradable.png","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":20,"padding_bottom":0}},"17df5dd3-4f9a-4f3d-940b-e27c87e4e2b1":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--16017383227549__17df5dd3-4f9a-4f3d-940b-e27c87e4e2b1-1674229600fd504cf0-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Impresoras 3D Filamentos Estandarizados","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--16017383227549__17df5dd3-4f9a-4f3d-940b-e27c87e4e2b1-1674229600fd504cf0-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Un grabe problema con los filamentos baratos, es que su grosor no esta estandarizado, es decir, que puede aumentar o disminuir aleatoriamente.<br\/>Si aumenta su grosor, genera presión en el extrusor y puede arruinar los engranajes internos, y estropear la impresión.<br\/>Si disminuye el grosor no tiene el ancho para que el engranaje los puedan empujar.<br\/>Nos aseguramos de que nuestros filamentos estén <strong>estandarizados<\/strong> con una precisión de variación menor a 0,05mm.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["template--16017383227549__17df5dd3-4f9a-4f3d-940b-e27c87e4e2b1-1674229600fd504cf0-0","template--16017383227549__17df5dd3-4f9a-4f3d-940b-e27c87e4e2b1-1674229600fd504cf0-1"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Filamentos_Print3x.png","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":20,"padding_bottom":0}},"7466ca58-3106-4b8e-b1c2-148234ca53bd":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--16017383227549__7466ca58-3106-4b8e-b1c2-148234ca53bd-1674229600fd504cf0-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Dimensiones del Rollo de PLA 1 kg","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--16017383227549__7466ca58-3106-4b8e-b1c2-148234ca53bd-1674229600fd504cf0-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Las dimensiones del rollo de PLA son de<\/p><p>20 cm de diámetro del rollo<br\/>6 cm del agujero interno<br\/>6,5 cm de ancho del carrete de PLA<\/p><p>Diámetro del PLA: 1.75 mm ± 0.05<br\/>Cantidad de Metros: 335 mt de filamento por rollo<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["template--16017383227549__7466ca58-3106-4b8e-b1c2-148234ca53bd-1674229600fd504cf0-0","template--16017383227549__7466ca58-3106-4b8e-b1c2-148234ca53bd-1674229600fd504cf0-1"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Dimensiones_del_Rollo_PLA.png","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":20,"padding_bottom":0}},"4cfc4046-a534-47a8-8d99-20468eee1ec2":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--16017383227549__4cfc4046-a534-47a8-8d99-20468eee1ec2-1674229600fd504cf0-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Sin Olor el filamentos pla 3d","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--16017383227549__4cfc4046-a534-47a8-8d99-20468eee1ec2-1674229600fd504cf0-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Durante la impresión, otros filamentos arrojan un olor que en acumulación puede ocasionar dolor de cabeza.<br\/><br\/>Nuestro filamento <strong>no emite<\/strong> ningún tipo de olor durante la impresión.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["template--16017383227549__4cfc4046-a534-47a8-8d99-20468eee1ec2-1674229600fd504cf0-0","template--16017383227549__4cfc4046-a534-47a8-8d99-20468eee1ec2-1674229600fd504cf0-1"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Nariz_de_gato.png","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":20,"padding_bottom":0}},"962742ed-667b-46cf-b367-46bc8370a8e8":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--16017383227549__962742ed-667b-46cf-b367-46bc8370a8e8-1674229600fd504cf0-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Protección UV del filamento pla chile","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--16017383227549__962742ed-667b-46cf-b367-46bc8370a8e8-1674229600fd504cf0-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Seleccionamos un proveedor que utiliza un complejante que protege un 30% más el plástico de los quiebres generados por la exposición a rayos UV del sol.<\/p><p>De todas maneras, sí la exposición es prolongada, el plástico PLA puede perder sus propiedades.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["template--16017383227549__962742ed-667b-46cf-b367-46bc8370a8e8-1674229600fd504cf0-0","template--16017383227549__962742ed-667b-46cf-b367-46bc8370a8e8-1674229600fd504cf0-1"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Sol_dibujo.png","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":20,"padding_bottom":0}},"f05a442d-6ada-413a-8d3c-170f21769137":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--16017383227549__f05a442d-6ada-413a-8d3c-170f21769137-1674229600fd504cf0-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"¿ Es reciclable el filamento pla 3d?","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--16017383227549__f05a442d-6ada-413a-8d3c-170f21769137-1674229600fd504cf0-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Nuestro PLA es totalmente <strong>reciclable <\/strong>y te pedimos que recicles todo el material de sobra de una impresión 3D.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["template--16017383227549__f05a442d-6ada-413a-8d3c-170f21769137-1674229600fd504cf0-0","template--16017383227549__f05a442d-6ada-413a-8d3c-170f21769137-1674229600fd504cf0-1"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Reciclaje_Print3x.png","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":20,"padding_bottom":0}},"6f4cefff-c2f2-4f60-810b-a11561040f30":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--16017383227549__6f4cefff-c2f2-4f60-810b-a11561040f30-1674229600fd504cf0-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Baja Hidrolisis del filamento pla 1.75","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--16017383227549__6f4cefff-c2f2-4f60-810b-a11561040f30-1674229600fd504cf0-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>La Hidrólisis es un proceso en el cual las moléculas de agua rompen los enlaces del polímero (el plástico). Para evitar este proceso que rompe el plástico, el filamento <strong>tiene aditivos<\/strong> que reaccionan antes con el agua para evitar que interactúe con el polímero del filamento.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["template--16017383227549__6f4cefff-c2f2-4f60-810b-a11561040f30-1674229600fd504cf0-0","template--16017383227549__6f4cefff-c2f2-4f60-810b-a11561040f30-1674229600fd504cf0-1"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/baja_hidrolisis.png","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":20,"padding_bottom":0}},"98709001-25c3-45ed-a879-d74b40b7b66b":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--16017383227549__98709001-25c3-45ed-a879-d74b40b7b66b-1674229600fd504cf0-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Garantía completa del mejor pla","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--16017383227549__98709001-25c3-45ed-a879-d74b40b7b66b-1674229600fd504cf0-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>En caso de que compres nuestros filamentos y tengas problemas con la calidad, o en alguno de los puntos mencionados, te lo cambiamos gratis, incluyendo el envío que también corre por nuestra cuenta<\/p>","text_style":"body"}},"7b4e596e-1656-4395-aae7-e0541a2e9aeb":{"type":"caption","disabled":true,"settings":{"caption":"En caso de que el grosor del filamento no este en el rango que garantizamos (sea mayor a 1.8 mm o menor a 1.7 mm) y en caso de que el filamento se quiebre solo.","text_style":"caption-with-letter-spacing","text_size":"medium"}}},"block_order":["template--16017383227549__98709001-25c3-45ed-a879-d74b40b7b66b-1674229600fd504cf0-0","template--16017383227549__98709001-25c3-45ed-a879-d74b40b7b66b-1674229600fd504cf0-1","7b4e596e-1656-4395-aae7-e0541a2e9aeb"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Badge-garantia-dorado.png","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":20,"padding_bottom":0}},"3ccd58c2-e837-4008-8456-e3e762f7cb3e":{"type":"collapsible-content","blocks":{"template--16020775272605__3ccd58c2-e837-4008-8456-e3e762f7cb3e-167493936991d27666-0":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Filamento Creality","icon":"check_mark","row_content":"<p>Dado que el diámetro del <strong>filamento pla creality<\/strong> es el mismo de nuestro Filamento PLA, se puede ocupar indistintamente, lo que sí tienes que ver, es que nuestra temperatura de funcionamiento puede ser distinta que la de ese filamento.<\/p>","page":""}},"template--16020775272605__3ccd58c2-e837-4008-8456-e3e762f7cb3e-167493936991d27666-1":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Filamento pla Ender","icon":"check_mark","row_content":"<p>Dado que el diámetro del <strong>filamento pla ender<\/strong> es el mismo de nuestro Filamento PLA, se puede ocupar indistintamente, lo que sí tienes que ver, es que nuestra temperatura de funcionamiento puede ser distinta que la de ese filamento.<\/p>","page":""}},"template--16020775272605__3ccd58c2-e837-4008-8456-e3e762f7cb3e-1674